it."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Continuity","timestamp_seconds":1.5,"problem":"Several adjacent frames in the prep section feel nearly identical, reducing perceived progression.","fix":"Use fewer frames from the same source window and cut on more visible action changes."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Brand","timestamp_seconds":12,"problem":"Brand presence is late and functional only; it lacks a truly premium branded hero moment.","fix":"Bring the brand lockup onto a cleaner frame and simplify the final frame so the restaurant name lands with confidence."}]
